<title>USA: Ericsson says Qualcomm suit without merit.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says Qualcomm suit without merit.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ericsson Inc, a unit of Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson, said Wednesday it would vigorously defend itself against a lawsuit filed Tuesday by Qualcomm Inc.</p>
<p>It said Qualcomm's allegations of unfair competition were &quot;completely without merit.&quot;</p>
<p>Ericsson said it would press its own legal claim that Qualcomm has infringed Ericsson patents related to Code Division Multiple Access technology.</p>
</text>
